    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mulungu namuji ntūngīlīja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ū bebe ūyo ūkūnamulaga ūngī, managa gīkī, nū bebe ūtī na sha kwibūūlīla; nīyo ūdeebe gīkī, ūmo ūkūnamulīlaga ng'wiyo hū ūkwilamulaga bebe ng'wenekīlī, nguno īyo ūkwībalaga kūbiza yabūbi, nū bebe ūkūyītaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo tūmanile gīkī ū būlamuji bo ng'wa Mulungu ūbo akabūtūmamīlaga kūbalamula abo bakīītaga mihayo īlī gīko, ū wene būlī bo ng'hana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe ūlī munhū dūhū, ī gīsī īkī ūkūbalamulaga abo bakwītaga mihayo īyo nū bebe ūkwīyītaga, ūkwiganikaga gīkī ūkūgwiliga ū nsango go ng'wa Mulungu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū hamo ūkūbūdalahaga ū wiza bo ng'wa Mulungu, nū wiyūmīlīja bokwe, pyī nū būlindīīji bokwe? Ūtūmanaga gīkī ū wiza bokwe būlīkūduta wingīle mu kūgalūka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo īkī ūlī ngang'hanazu, nīng'holò yako ītatogilwe ū kūgalūka, managa gīkī ūkwibīkīlaga būpelanu a ha lūshikū lo būpelanu, aho būlamuji bo ng'wa Mulungu būkūkundūlīlwa mu būtūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno akūngabīla būlī ng'wene kūlenganīla na nhūmamīle yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A biyūmīlīja mu kwīta yawiza, na kūkooba mihayo y'ikūjo na kūkumīlīja, a bachooji ba mihayo īyo ītī ya kūkenaagūka, a benabo akūbinha būpanga butashilaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo abo bakashimīzīlaga mu nhūngwa ja malofu, a bachooji ba mihayo yabo ya benekīlī dūhū, abo balemile kūshimīzīla mu ng'hana, a bene bakūmalīlwa shiilī mu būpelanu būtaale! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būkūbiza ho būluhi na makoye mataale kūlwa būlī munhū ūyo akīītaga yabūbi, abize Nyudaya nūūlū w'ihanga līngī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo būlī ng'wene ūyo akīītaga mihayo yawiza, līkūbiza ho ikūjo na kūkumīlījiwa na mhola kūlwa nguno yakwe ū wa gīko, abize Nyudaya nūūlū w'ihanga līngī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Mulungu atī na būsolanhya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bakīītaga shibi alīyo batī na shilagīlo, bakūyagala mu būtūbiza na shilagīlo; na a babo bakīītaga shibi alīyo balī na shilagīlo, nabo bakūlamulwa mu nzīla ya shilagīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkī ū kūlī Mulungu a batūngīlīja bat'abo bakagelelaga kūshidegeleka dūhū ī shilagīlo, alīyo a bīīti ba mihayo īyo yoolechiwe ū mu shilagīlo h'abo bakabalīlagwa būtūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno na a banhū ba mahanga abo batī ha sīlīlī ya shilagīlo ūlū bīīta īyo yidomanīgije na shilagīlo sha kasūmbīlwe, ū mu gīko babizaga shilagīlo kū boi benekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu kwīta gīko bakoolechaga gīkī, a katongeelele ka shilagīlo kandīkile ū mung'holò jabo, nguno na a maganiko gabo gakabakaanīlaga, nūūlū kūbalwīlīla; īkī būlī ng'wene alī na wiyangūji bokwe ng'wenekīlī ūbo būkankaanīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo īkūbizīla nū mu lūshikū lo ng'wa Mulungu kwīlamula ī mihayo ya mbisīla ja banhū mu nzīla ya ng'wa Yesu Kilisito, ūmo joolekegije Ng'hūlū Jawiza ījo nakūjilomeelaga nene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bayudaya na shilagīlo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū bebe ūlū ūkahayiagwa gīkī ūlī Nyudaya, na ūsendamīlile shilagīlo, hama ūkikumīlījaga gīkī ūmanile ū Mulungu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nī yīyo ayītogilwe wīmanile, nī yawiza ūmanīle ū kwīsola nguno ūlangilwe ī shilagīlo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūmanile na gīkī ūlī ntongeeji wa babboku, n'isana lya ba mu giiti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na gīkī ūlī ng'hūgūji wa bachilū chilū, na nangi wa banīgīnī, īkī ūshimanile ī shilagīlo, nī ng'hana wīdeebile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ū bebe ūyo ūlī nangi wa bangī, ūtilangaga ū bebe ng'wenekīlī? Ūkalomeelaga gīkī yaya ū kwiba, alīyo ū bebe ūkibaga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkahayaga gīkī yaya ū kūshihya, alīyo ū bebe ng'wenekīlī ūkashihyaga? Ū bebe ūtitogagwa na shiikolile sha kūlamiwa, alīyo ū kūnū ūja ūkwibaga sha mu maduku ga masamva? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe ūkikumīlījaga kūlwa shilagīlo, ū kūnū ūndalaha ū Mulungu kūlwa kūshikenaagūla ī shilagīlo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno gwandīkilwe gīkī, “Ī lina lya ng'wa Mulungu līkūsondagūlagwa mu mahanga kūlwa nguno ying'we!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ī chene ū mhayo go kūsaalwa gūlī na solobo ūlū ūbiza ūlī nshikīlīja washo ī shilagīlo, alīyo ūlū ūbiza ūlī nkenaagūji washo ī shilagīlo, ū būsaalwa wako būkūbiza gītī būtūsaalwa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ū munhū nūūlū ūbiza atasaalilwe, alīyo akūshimīzīlaga mu katongeelele ka shilagīlo, ū mu mbika yakwe ya būtūsaalwa atūbalwa gīkī asaalilwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ūyo atasaalilwe ūlū ūshidima ī shilagīlo, akūkwenheleja nsango ū bebe ūyo ūsaalilwe, nī shandīkwa sha shilagīlo ūlī nasho alīyo ūtashidimile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Nyudaya higūlya gūlya dūhū atī Nyudaya ū ng'wenūyo, nū yūyo asaalilwe higūlya gūlya dūhū nang'hwe atasaalilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Nyudaya wa ng'hana, ng'wene alī wa būmunhū bo mu gatī, nū būsaalwa bo ng'hana būlī mu ng'holò, mhayo gwa mu moyo, ītī mu kūlondeela wandīke dūhū. Ū kūkumīlījiwa kwa ng'wa munhū ūyo alī gīko kūtafumaga kū banhū, kūkafumaga kūlī Mulungu!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.2.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
